      "text": "Sentiment balance reads 92.3 against the show's usual 100. The negative notes came from E6 LinkedIn viewers who said they couldn't hear the caller.",
      "recommendation": "Run a caller audio check before going live this week and set caller levels in the stream mix. Ask in chat early whether the caller is audible, and note any complaints that follow."
    },
